%% FRRouting: route installation into the FIB
flowchart TD
    A["Protocol daemon<br/>receives/computes route"] --> B["Sends route to zebra via ZAPI"]
    B --> C{"Other routes exist<br/>for the same prefix?"}
    C -- No --> F["Route selected"]
    C -- Yes --> D{"Compare<br/>administrative distance"}
    D -- "Lowest AD wins" --> F
    D -- "Equal AD" --> E{"Compare metric"}
    E --> F
    F --> G{"Nexthop reachable?"}
    G -- No --> H["Route stays in RIB<br/>not installed in FIB"]
    G -- Yes --> I["Install into kernel via netlink"]
    I --> J["Route active in FIB"]
